## Summary

The GESIS Knowledge Graph is a multi-graph system with three distinct components:

1. **System Metadata Graph** (<http://www.openlinksw.com/schemas/virtrdf#>): Contains Virtuoso triple store configuration with 92 properties and 12 entity types, primarily focused on SQL-to-RDF mapping formats.

2. **Ontology Graph** (<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>): Contains standard OWL vocabulary definitions with 15 properties and 6 entity types, providing the semantic foundation.

3. **Research Data Graph** (<https://data.gesis.org/gesiskg>): The main content graph with 120+ properties and 34 entity types, containing over 3.7 million entities including:
